{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":26.31999969482422,"text":"An enormous vessel, almost 90 centimeters tall, made from a copper alloy with a lot of tin in it, which gives it a golden color without any gold at all. Its whole surface is worked with dancing figures, in relief so high that some of them come away from the body of the vase. A crater was normally made from mixing wine with water at a feast. This one ended up as a container for ashes, and burnt bones were found inside it.","words":[{"word":"An","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"enormous","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":1.100000023841858},{"word":"vessel","start":1.100000023841858,"end":1.5800000429153442},{"word":"almost","start":1.9600000381469727,"end":2.240000009536743},{"word":"90","start":2.240000009536743,"end":2.8399999141693115},{"word":"centimeters","start":2.8399999141693115,"end":3.319999933242798},{"word":"tall","start":3.319999933242798,"end":3.8399999141693115},{"word":"made","start":4.340000152587891,"end":4.440000057220459},{"word":"from","start":4.440000057220459,"end":4.619999885559082},{"word":"a","start":4.619999885559082,"end":5.139999866485596},{"word":"copper","start":5.139999866485596,"end":5.139999866485596},{"word":"alloy","start":5.139999866485596,"end":5.579999923706055},{"word":"with","start":5.579999923706055,"end":5.840000152587891},{"word":"a","start":5.840000152587891,"end":6.039999961853027},{"word":"lot","start":6.039999961853027,"end":6.199999809265137},{"word":"of","start":6.199999809265137,"end":6.579999923706055},{"word":"tin","start":6.579999923706055,"end":6.579999923706055},{"word":"in","start":6.579999923706055,"end":6.78000020980835},{"word":"it","start":6.78000020980835,"end":7.019999980926514},{"word":"which","start":7.179999828338623,"end":7.440000057220459},{"word":"gives","start":7.440000057220459,"end":7.599999904632568},{"word":"it","start":7.599999904632568,"end":7.760000228881836},{"word":"a","start":7.760000228881836,"end":7